446	   {t:'<code>super().__init__()</code> calls <code>_do_reset()</code> as part of the IEEE 488.2 power-on reset sequence, which runs before <code>self._log = []</code> is reached in the subclass.',correct:false,why:'super().__init__() calls _setup_handlers(), not _do_reset(). _do_reset() is only called by reset(). However, if a handler registered by _setup_handlers() is invoked during __init__ for some reason, a missing attribute would also crash.'},
